  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d0ccca1471d34164ba6a48d39b9b87a9, type: 3}
  m_Name: GatePuzzleTidbit
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BoundSpiritRuntime::InformationalTidbitData
  title: 
  body: "In cybersecurity, even tiny pieces of information can matter. When you talked
    to the three ghosts and learned the order \u2014 circle \u2192 square \u2192
    triangle \u2014 you collected hints that unlocked a puzzle. At a base level,
    real attackers do the same thing: they gather small clues from people to figure
    out how to break into systems. That\u2019s why being careful about what you share
    keeps things safer."
